sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant KC as Keycloak
    participant Email as User's Email Client
    participant BE as Backend Service
    participant KC_Admin_API as Keycloak Admin API

    rect rgb(173, 216, 230)
        Note over User, KC: Self-Serve Password Reset
        User->>KC: 1: Clicks "Forgot Password" on login page
        KC->>Email: 2: Sends password reset link
        User->>Email: 3: Opens email and clicks link
        Email-->>KC: Opens password reset page
        User->>KC: 4: Submits new password
        KC->>User: 5: Confirms password change
    end

    rect rgb(144, 238, 144)
        Note over BE, KC_Admin_API: Admin API for Role Management
        BE->>+KC: 6: Authenticates using Client Credentials
        KC-->>-BE: 7: Returns Access Token for Admin API
        BE->>+KC_Admin_API: 8: POST /users/{id}/role-mappings (assigns role)
        KC_Admin_API-->>-BE: 9: Returns 200 OK
    end